<p>For guests staying at the hotel, that setting means a coastal stay defined as much by the mountains behind the town as by the sea in front of it, with the Serra de Tramuntana's hiking trails, viewpoints, and villages all within reach of a base in Port de Sóller, alongside the more conventional pleasures of a harbour-front hotel with direct access to the bay.</p>
